abstract: >-
  Presents GatedC G-LHW, a frozen design-time and online learning-rate selection
  and dispersion-gated tempering rule for generalised Bayesian optimal experimental
  design (GBOED) under predictive-centered inverse multi-quadric weighted score
  matching (PredC IMQ-WSM), anchored on Barlas, Sloman, and Kaski (arXiv:2511.07671).
